# This repo is cloned into many different projects' <ProjectRoot>/WeekendWarriorDevTools/.
# Every tool writes its generated reports to <ProjectRoot>/Documentation/ (outside this folder)
# instead of alongside the scripts, so a project's own scan results never leak into this shared
# repo. These patterns are a safety net for any script (or manual run) that still writes locally.
outputs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
